WEBVTT

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:34.330
On a Walk

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:33.120
On a walk!

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:36.580
Whoa!

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:44.250
You have a new message

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:44.250
From Takagi-san?

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:46.120
What's she want?

00:01:48.330 --> 00:01:49.170
A doggy!

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:51.330
But why she'd send this?

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:55.210
This one was taken in a different place...

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:56.750
Is she walking it?

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:01.330
No way... did Takagi-san get a dog?

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:06.380
I'm walking this dog for someone,

00:02:02.420 --> 00:02:06.380
would you like to join me?

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:06.960
I'm walking this dog for someone,
would you like to join me?

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:19.290
You got here fast, Nishikata.

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:20.580
Well, yeah.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:24.880
I just happened... to be passing close by

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:24.880
when I got your message...

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:27.790
I thought you were lazing around at home

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:31.330
and sprinted all the way here because
you were excited to walk the dog.

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:33.120
She knows!

00:02:34.120 --> 00:02:34.920
Whatever, forget that.

00:02:34.920 --> 00:02:36.080
Because I get to walk...

00:02:36.790 --> 00:02:38.000
a real dog!

00:02:38.750 --> 00:02:43.920
I've always dreamed of this moment! And now it's here!

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:49.750
You sure do love dogs, huh?

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:54.790
N-not really. I mean, I don't hate them or anything...

00:02:56.620 --> 00:02:58.750
Okay. Let's get going.

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:11.460
This rules!

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:14.170
But...

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:16.540
I wanna hold the leash!

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:20.040
The leash is the most fundamental part of any dog walk.

00:03:20.290 --> 00:03:23.040
You just can't have a dog walk without a leash!

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:29.710
Guess I'll just ask her straight up.

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:32.830
Can I have the leash?

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:35.290
Ha ha!

00:03:36.580 --> 00:03:39.040
Wow. Just look at you, so desperate to walk a dog.

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:41.460
No! I can't!

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:44.420
I gotta think of something else...

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:45.540
Hey, Nishikata.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.080
Would you like to hold the leash for a bit?

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:51.040
Huh?

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:53.670
Why'd she ask me all of a sudden?!

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:55.080
Is that a no?

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:57.960
Huh? No! I'll take it, no problem.

00:04:02.120 --> 00:04:06.670
I'm really doing it! I'm walking a dog right now!

00:04:07.620 --> 00:04:11.500
Guess what, Nishikata?

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:11.500
I hear this dog really likes running.

00:04:11.500 --> 00:04:12.460
Oh?

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:16.750
W-well, then maybe I should run
with it for just a little while...

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:17.500
Sure.

00:04:17.960 --> 00:04:21.420
I'm going to keep walking.
Just wait for me near the shrine, okay?

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:24.330
Okay. See ya!

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:29.710
This is awesome!

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:30.830
I'm on a run!

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.710
I'm on a run with a dog!

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:49.330
Whew! I'm beat!

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:55.380
Takagi-san said she was going to walk here,
which means that I've got time to kill.

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:57.170
Perfect.

00:04:57.670 --> 00:05:00.170
Aw, aren't you adorable!

00:05:00.170 --> 00:05:02.460
Who's a good boy? You're a good boy! Yes you are!

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:05.420
Aw! You like that? I'll give you all the pets!

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:10.750
Such a fluffy good boy! Yes you are! And so cute!

00:05:09.710 --> 00:05:10.750
Nishikata?

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:14.750
Oh, there you are.

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:18.290
Did you have fun?

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:22.040
S-sorta. I guess I got some good exercise.

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:28.830
Did you enjoy that, boy? You ran so far.

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:36.080
Hey, Takagi-san. Do you want to have the leash back?

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:41.540
I feel kinda bad since I've been hogging it for so long.

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:45.120
That's okay.

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:48.620
You look like you're having a lot more fun

00:05:45.130 --> 00:05:48.620
holding it than I was, anyway.

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:49.500
Huh?!

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:52.620
A-as if! This is n-nothing special. Nope.

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:57.170
Besides, the truth is, I'm enjoying myself plenty right now.

00:05:57.920 --> 00:05:58.920
Because...

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.380
Because what?

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:06.920
Just try and guess.

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:07.380
Huh?

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:09.210
Uh, I'm stumped.

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:33.000
How fun was that!

00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:34.710
Totally!

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:38.920
Uh, well, it was decent exercise. That's all.

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:47.960
Besides, the truth is, I'm enjoying myself plenty right now.

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:49.210
Because...

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:51.710
"Because" what?

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:58.960
Are you curious to know what comes after the "because"?

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:02.000
Nah, not really.

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:04.880
Okay. I'll send you a text with it.

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:07.330
It's something hard to say.

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:14.000
Done. See for yourself.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:27.120
Wha?!

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.460
I snapped a great pic!

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:36.420
You sure do love dogs, Nishikata!

00:07:36.420 --> 00:07:38.750
Wh-whatever! It's normal!

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:41.580
Seriously! I'm not obsessed or anything!

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:50.290
What's the matter?

00:07:50.290 --> 00:07:53.250
I left my dang homework at school...

00:07:53.920 --> 00:07:56.960
It's a waste of time, but I have to go back and get it.

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:01.620
Bye, Takagi-san. See you tomorrow.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:08.920
I'll go with you.

00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:14.250
Left at School

00:08:11.620 --> 00:08:12.830
Left at school!

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:21.460
This feels weird.
It's like we're coming to school super late.

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:23.540
You're right.

00:08:29.210 --> 00:08:32.040
I didn't realize how many kids stayed late after school.

00:08:32.750 --> 00:08:35.500
I hear they stick around to chat
and hang out with each other.

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:38.960
Especially since there are a lot
of new couples after Culture Fest.

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:40.380
Oh?

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:42.120
Because of Culture Fest, huh?

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:47.210
Ever since that spring day when we first met each other.

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:49.880
You are my one and only, prince charming!

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:55.040
Weird.

00:08:57.920 --> 00:09:00.790
So like, why stay behind just to talk and stuff?

00:09:01.670 --> 00:09:03.670
Because they want to spend time together.

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:05.750
That's all?

00:09:06.170 --> 00:09:08.380
Seems like a good enough reason to me.

00:09:09.420 --> 00:09:10.540
Uh-huh.

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:16.500
Wait, if that's really true then...

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:20.250
won't people think that we're a couple
for walking around like this?

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:29.830
No, don't be silly! I'm only here
to pick up something I forgot.

00:09:29.830 --> 00:09:30.830
That's it!

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:33.080
But at the same time...

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:35.670
I'm starving.

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:36.250
Same.

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:37.460
It's killing me.

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:38.790
Okay, wanna go grab a snack?

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:39.960
Yeah, sounds good.

00:09:40.380 --> 00:09:42.790
We are totally ordering the giant tower
of donut holes covered in sugar.

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:41.790
Sorry, Takagi-san!

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:42.460
Huh?

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:44.420
But dude, I don't have that much on me...

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:44.290
Gotta hit the bathroom!

00:09:49.250 --> 00:09:52.500
Oh hey, it's Takagi-san. You're still here?

00:09:52.500 --> 00:09:53.920
That's a surprise.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:55.040
Great!

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:59.620
I'll sneak out the bathroom window.

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:07.960
Then use a different route to go pick up
my homework and head straight home.

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:09.790
The perfect plan!

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:12.040
What do you say we practice for
the big tournament together?

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:15.500
Where do you think we should go during the next break?

00:10:15.500 --> 00:10:16.080
How about...

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:19.790
I am noticing a lot of girls and boys hanging out together.

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:23.080
Oh, it's Nishikata.

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:26.500
Nakai-kun and Mano-san?

00:10:26.880 --> 00:10:28.960
Yo. Whatcha doing?

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:31.330
Uh, I just came back for something.

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:35.330
Come on, Nakai-kun.
You don't even need to ask him, do you?

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:37.540
He's the same as us!

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:41.250
No! Seriously! I forgot my homework!

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:41.710
Um, so...

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:44.500
I get it. Must be Takagi-san, then.

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:46.040
That's right. Let's leave him be.

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:50.120
See ya, dude.

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:53.170
Y-you've got the wrong idea!

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.380
Hey, we should get going soon.

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:58.380
There's no point in staying at school.

00:10:58.380 --> 00:11:01.080
Being together is the point, dummy!

00:11:02.710 --> 00:11:05.170
I'm getting my homework and then getting out of here.

00:11:11.540 --> 00:11:13.080
Took you long enough.

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:14.540
What?!

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:17.120
I thought she was going to wait for me by the bathroom!

00:11:18.290 --> 00:11:20.880
Did you think I was going to wait by the bathroom?

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:21.670
Urk!

00:11:23.920 --> 00:11:29.540
Or maybe... you were afraid we'd be seen as
a couple for walking together after school,

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:32.920
so you went a different way
while trying to leave me behind?

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.620
D-dunno.

00:11:43.170 --> 00:11:44.960
There sure are a lot of them.

00:11:44.960 --> 00:11:45.880
Huh?

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:48.420
The couples who stick around after school.

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:54.960
I'm not so sure. I didn't see anybody like that at all.

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:58.170
At all? Really?

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:03.540
M-more importantly, I got my homework.
Let's hurry and get out of here.

00:12:03.540 --> 00:12:04.960
Oh, Nishikata!

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:09.380
You really did stick around to be with Takagi-san!

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:13.120
N-no, it's not... I just came to pick up my homework!

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:14.580
Later, man!

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.580
Uh, are you listening?

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:25.540
You were saying something about
"not seeing any couples"?

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:28.500
Um, well... anyway!

00:12:28.750 --> 00:12:31.620
We should really get going. Come on.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:34.540
Hey, Nishikata.

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:37.920
Let's stick around here for a little longer.

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:44.460
No, let's leave...

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:46.500
Why? You embarrassed?

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:48.620
N-no, that is not the case!

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:52.580
I just don't see a reason to stay any longer...

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:01.710
Well, I have a reason. Wanna know what?

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:02.500
Huh?

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:09.710
I figured that since we're already here,
I'll just get all my homework done now!

00:13:09.710 --> 00:13:11.830
Homework...?

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:18.580
Did you think I meant something else?

00:13:21.960 --> 00:13:24.460
It's called homework because
we're supposed to do it at home!

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:25.580
That's true!

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:27.210
Let's go then.

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:27.830
Okay!

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.710
Boy, so much homework I gotta get done!

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:35.000
Christmas isn't too far off now.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:40.290
Santa Claus?

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:38.540
Santa Claus?

00:13:41.250 --> 00:13:44.500
I suppose all the couples are gonna spend it together.

00:13:45.210 --> 00:13:47.790
Like Takagi-chan and Mano-chan.

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:53.250
Actually, I heard that Takagi-chan and
Nishikata aren't actually dating. Yet.

00:13:53.250 --> 00:13:56.380
Well, they might as well be. Just look at them.

00:13:56.790 --> 00:13:59.330
So? You desperate for a boyfriend or what?

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:02.380
N-no, not really.

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:08.000
Speaking of which! What did you guys
ask Santa to get you for Christmas this year?

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:11.120
You veered pretty far off subject there.

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:16.380
I'm asking for some warm gloves and a scarf.

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:20.380
That figures, since you're always cold!

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:21.540
What about you, Mina?

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:25.250
I haven't decided yet.

00:14:25.250 --> 00:14:27.120
There's just too many things that I want.

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:29.080
As you do.

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:30.580
What about you, Sanae-chan?

00:14:30.830 --> 00:14:33.380
We don't do Christmas presents at my house.

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:35.290
I mean, I'm in middle school.

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:37.670
What?! B-but why?!

00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:39.460
I didn't know that could happen!

00:14:39.750 --> 00:14:42.000
Huh? Why are you freaking out?

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:45.080
S-so Christmas varies by house?

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:46.250
Then what about mine?!

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:50.380
Will I be getting a Christmas present this year or not?!

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:53.830
Don't ask us. That's a question for your parents.

00:14:53.830 --> 00:14:54.790
WHAT?!

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:59.040
You mean my mom and dad have inside info?!

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:00.920
About when and where Santa Claus comes?!

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:06.210
Santa Claus is actually...

00:15:07.120 --> 00:15:09.290
Don't shatter her dreams.

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:12.290
I'm gonna ask as soon as I get home.

00:15:12.290 --> 00:15:15.170
I really hope I get a present this year...

00:15:16.540 --> 00:15:19.500
LIBRARY

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:22.750
Okay! Let's get pumped up for library duty!

00:15:22.960 --> 00:15:25.420
Who gets pumped up for peace and quiet?

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:30.620
Another book on dogs?

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:33.790
What's wrong with that? I like them.

00:15:35.670 --> 00:15:37.330
That comes as no surprise.

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:42.920
Well, guess I'll get to work.

00:15:53.290 --> 00:15:57.290
Knitting

00:15:54.750 --> 00:15:55.750
Knitting.

00:15:58.500 --> 00:15:59.750
Is that a knitting set?

00:16:00.170 --> 00:16:02.460
You know how to knit, Takagi-san?!

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:07.080
I just started recently. I'm still pretty slow.

00:16:15.670 --> 00:16:17.290
Incredible!

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:20.120
I didn't know she had that kind of skill!

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:24.040
Takagi-san really has a fearsome repertoire!

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:31.210
Do you want to give it a try?

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:32.580
Huh?

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:35.620
I have a spare set.

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:37.750
Here.

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:41.620
Uh, isn't it kinda hard to do?

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:45.250
It's easy once you get the hang of it.

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:49.960
You start by doing this.

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:52.250
Then hook it through like this.

00:16:54.210 --> 00:16:55.000
See?

00:16:55.750 --> 00:16:56.670
Um...

00:16:57.880 --> 00:17:02.500
First go like this, then hook and... huh?

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:08.710
You have to make a loop, and
then put it through from the bottom.

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:11.500
Like this?

00:17:15.620 --> 00:17:17.670
It's hard to teach by just explaining.

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:23.830
Look, right here.

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:31.080
Are you watching?
First go like this, then this, and done!

00:17:39.460 --> 00:17:41.000
Are you following so far?

00:17:46.880 --> 00:17:50.960
Th-that's enough for me. It's just too frustrating.

00:17:50.960 --> 00:17:51.710
Aw, boo.

00:18:02.120 --> 00:18:03.790
Too humiliating, huh?

00:18:05.420 --> 00:18:07.620
No, I said "frustrating"!

00:18:17.920 --> 00:18:21.000
S-so, are you making a scarf or something?

00:18:22.670 --> 00:18:24.790
Close, it's a type of winter clothing.

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:32.250
Want me to make one for you, too?

00:18:32.250 --> 00:18:33.000
Huh?

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:37.080
No, I'm good...

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:39.880
Too humiliating, huh?

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:55.960
Hey. I'm thinking about knitting some letters into it.

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:57.420
What color do you think is best?

00:18:57.420 --> 00:18:58.210
Letters?

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:01.250
Why not just use whatever color you like?

00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:04.580
Well...

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:07.290
It's supposed to be a present.

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:09.960
Oh?

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:13.210
Is it for your dad?

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:30.330
Th-then a present for your mom, maybe?

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:31.670
Nope.

00:19:36.380 --> 00:19:37.250
So...

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:39.170
You're really curious about it, huh?

00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:41.290
No! Not really!

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:46.330
Uh, I was just thinking a good color
would depend on who you gave it to...

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:47.330
Oh.

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:50.670
So you were trying to help me decide on a good color.

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:52.880
Thank you.

00:19:57.120 --> 00:19:58.790
This will be a present for...

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:01.500
a 15 year-old boy.

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:04.830
A boy... who's older than her?!

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:16.380
What the heck? What is this feeling?

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:20.120
What color would you recommend?

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:25.250
Maybe red. That would be good.

00:20:25.790 --> 00:20:26.790
Okay.

00:20:27.210 --> 00:20:29.080
Then red it is.

00:20:44.040 --> 00:20:47.750
Something about this... really bothers me...

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:06.880
A doggy?

00:21:08.210 --> 00:21:09.460
But why?

00:21:10.960 --> 00:21:15.710
Oh wait. Takagi-san must understand
this weird feeling I'm having...

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:19.040
And now she's trying to cheer me up,

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:21.330
with this picture of a dog...

00:21:23.250 --> 00:21:24.460
That's the boy.

00:21:25.790 --> 00:21:26.540
Huh?

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:28.960
The 15 year-old boy.

00:21:31.750 --> 00:21:34.170
He belongs to an elderly woman in my neighborhood.

00:21:34.420 --> 00:21:39.960
Since he's a grandpa in dog years,
she asked me if I could knit some nice clothes for him.

00:21:41.710 --> 00:21:43.040
Is something bothering you?

00:21:48.750 --> 00:21:50.290
N-not at all.

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:56.960
Sure is empty in here.

00:21:57.710 --> 00:21:59.620
Are you trying to change the subject?

00:21:59.620 --> 00:22:01.170
Oh come off it.
